    StyleBox["parts", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["pairing", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "1bc985cd-bf13-4740-8c3f-7fa88eab5e34"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the element of the dIBL algebra of ",
 StyleBox["pairing", "TI"],
 " with the given parts, an Association from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", ",", 
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"f0579f92-d0df-46ef-b6ee-c52293235b2f"],
 " to the part ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", ",", 
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"9412583e-e9b8-443b-a986-d3290e8c4f28"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"ff225bda-8e14-4a23-ad70-1bf3919744e8"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["MaurerCartanElement"]], 
     "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/MaurerCartanElement", 
     "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["pairing", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "77e5c8dd-a499-42d9-8f5b-aa6f674b67ca"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the element whose BD action is ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"c0359171-2f7a-45ce-8f7b-70895fc4538a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The part ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", ",", 
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"0bccf643-b338-444c-ae6d-36af4a4e6e5d"],
 " is a sum of products of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptL]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2f4e0759-483a-4f66-9dd0-0d4c190c06e0"],
 " cyclic words with coefficients free of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HBar"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HBar", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "086bb8b8-11c0-4ea2-89d3-d80e6304558b"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptL]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3d9c7de2-baef-48bd-b210-11881a3a2842"],
 " is the number of factors and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["g", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8b6cf84b-c561-428c-964b-0fab14d62dd3"],
 " the genus."
}], "Notes",
 CellFrameLabels->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {Inherited, 
    Cell[
     TextData[{
      "26.09.30: Design review - the element is its parts m_{l,g}, keyed by \
{l, g} with l the number of factors and g the genus, as the paper writes a \
Maurer-Cartan element (design 2 of the names doc, R5d, kept by Pavel). Both \
forms give the inert MaurerCartanElement[<|\"Parts\" -> parts, \"Pairing\" -> \
pairing|>], one Association like every other object of the paclet: with the \
two-argument expression as the object, an input that built nothing (a part \
with the wrong number of factors, a product of the other convention) would \
look exactly like an element, and its summary box would show it as one, while \
MatchQ[e, MaurerCartanElement[_Association]] tells them apart. The parts form \
splits the sum of HBar^g m_{l,g} again and compares, so the two forms accept \
the same elements. The terms are kept as given, expanded and grouped by key, \
and words are not brought to their canonical rotation, so that the element of \
an expanded BD action s gives s back exactly; two elements written with \
different rotations of one word therefore compare unequal. The element is not \
required to solve the Maurer-Cartan equation, since the Ansatz carries \
unknowns; Obstruction and RelationsQ test it, in place of the former \
MaurerCartanEquation and MaurerCartanQ. Prior art: the Wolfram Language has \
no dIBL or BD algebras; the engine the verification suites load keeps a \
Maurer-Cartan element as a bare expression, mcCanonical = cyc[{\"x\", \"x\", \
\"y\"}], and T12/paclet-maurer-cartan-element pins both round trips, the \
accessors, the head of the parts and six inputs that are not elements.", 
       "\n\n", 
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         GridBox[{{
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Edit"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationButton"]]], 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "LastAnnotator"]], "pavel"}], 
             "TextAnnotator"], 
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Delete"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationRemoveButton"]]], ""}}, 
          GridBoxAlignment -> {
           "Columns" -> {Left, Left, Right, Right}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, 
          GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.68], 
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.02]}}]]], "\n"}], "TextAnnotation", 
     CellSize -> {590, Inherited}]}},
 CellTags->"TextAnnotation",
 CellID->462847536,ExpressionUUID->"b1d94189-67f4-4e68-8ebe-ee6e2b21ded3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The BD action of the element is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", ",", 
      StyleBox["g", "TI"]}],
     LimitsPositioning->True], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[HBar]", 
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]], " ", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", ",", 
      StyleBox["g", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"8b61e144-445f-4514-9480-ca625df4bc54"],
 ", and the second form splits ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 " into its parts."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"422a85f6-c97e-488f-93a5-3126ab5a5d3f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A part with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"ff1922b8-649f-441b-a5f4-d81d8d7a87ec"],
 " is a sum of cyclic words. The products of a part with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", "\[GreaterEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"6d6b92ed-2c5a-43d1-b352-8f524af45a03"],
 " carry the head of the convention of ",
 StyleBox["pairing", "TI"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SymmetricProduct"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SymmetricProduct",
     "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "eb39cc96-6c9b-4d97-b8f7-5f52778fa6c3"],
 " under ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Symmetric\>\""], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7c229d52-67ae-4dbc-9410-32a5cf430f6b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ExteriorProduct"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/ExteriorProduct", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9eb45de6-4273-4e00-b927-df8ef8e10f66"],
 " under ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exterior\>\""], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d685d8cf-9455-430b-bbc7-5dcf3c3517c6"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9572e5cd-22ae-48af-9634-ef56df77c650"],

Cell["A word may be given as the list of its particles.", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ab9a0497-7aa7-42b5-914b-32d4c0d8569c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The terms are kept as given, expanded and grouped by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[ScriptL]", ",", 
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"39dc65ef-0ec4-4c1b-8c32-917b8d6a05d4"],
 ". Words are not brought to a canonical rotation, so the element of an \
expanded BD action ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 " gives ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 " back."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"00d943d0-54db-472e-be04-aa62eaa931c7"],

Cell["The zero BD action gives the element with no parts.", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"539e7713-372d-4113-ad1a-1d9930e2612d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For an element ",
 StyleBox["m", "TI"],
 " the following properties are available:"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c221558a-87cc-4b1b-8d28-b5269a3807f3"],

